 "not_listed": "The icad.org directory root lists 1994, 1996-1998 and 2000-2011; the 2011 directory is empty. No listing for 1992 or for 2012 onward was reachable: the SMARTech series pages need JavaScript, its REST API returned HTTP 400/500 for search, item and relationship requests, its OAI-PMH ListRecords returned HTTP 500 and then reset the connection, and dblp's ICAD index served a bot-protection challenge that was not bypassed.",
